    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45788" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔφιππ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>on horseback, riding</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Eup.
				27
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. εἰς τὸν τόπον ἠνέχθη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.306f
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. ὄντες</span>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁπλιτεύοντες</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				14.10
			</span></i> (as v.l.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνδριὰς ἔ.</span>
			<i>an equestrian</i> statue, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Publ.</u>
				19
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. εἰκὼν χαλκῆ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Fab.</u>
					22
				</span></i>
			 (so, with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰκών</span> omitted,
				<i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				3.204.6
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βίος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Her.</u>
					19.19
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλύδων ἔ.</span> a rushing wave <i>of
				horses</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				733
			</span></i>.</div>
